body+='''<section class="experience-cadets shell" id="cadets"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">November 2021 — present</p><h2>Royal Canadian<br /><em>Air Cadets</em></h2></div><p>I’ve served with 851 Prince Edward Squadron and 661 Lt W F Sharpe Squadron. My work has grown to include instruction, mentoring, and senior squadron responsibilities.</p></div><div class="cadet-columns"><div><h3>Instruction &amp; mentorship</h3><p>I plan and deliver lessons, mentor junior cadets, and support training, ceremonial activities, and community service. I qualified as a Fitness and Sports Instructor on August 17, 2025.</p><h3>Summer training &amp; staff service</h3><p>I completed CAP 1 in 2022 and CAP 2 in summer 2023. In summer 2026, I served as a Staff Cadet Sergeant at Blackdown, with platoon leadership and company support across training, administration, logistics, and cadet welfare.</p><p>My practical work includes lesson plans, sports setup and officiating, safety checks, and a proposed FSI platoon duty schedule.</p>'''+tags(['leadership','instruction','planning','teamwork'])+'''<details class="plain-details" id="challenge-coins"><summary>Recognition &amp; challenge coins <span>+</span></summary><p>Lord Strathcona Medal, Air Cadet Service Medal, Top Cadet Instructor, Best Physical Fitness, and Legion poppy appreciation. I have received four challenge coins.</p>'''+link('/awards/','The recognition record')+'''</details></div><div class="rank-ladder"><p class="eyebrow">Cadet progression</p>'''+''.join(f'<div class="rank-row" data-reveal><time datetime="{x["date"]}">{date(x["date"])}</time><strong>{e(x["title"])}</strong></div>' for x in D['ranks'])+'''</div></div></section>'''
